/// Property inspection records including routine inspections, move-in/move-out inspections, and compliance checks. Contains inspection findings, condition assessments, and follow-up requirements. Grain = one row per inspection (44,754 rows). Actively related only to Tenancy via Property Tenancy ID; Property ID, Property Maintenance ID and the Dim* surrogate keys are carried as reference identifiers but have no active model relationship (reach Property via Tenancy).
