	/// Human-readable reference code for the individual inspection record, formatted like 'I-048752' (every value is prefixed 'I-'). It is unique per inspection, so its distinct count equals the table row count, and it is never blank. This identifies a single inspection record, not an inspection type - group by Category or Type to analyse by inspection type.
	column 'Inspection Code'
		dataType: string
		lineageTag: 963e06d2-7c93-415b-973c-668509c64203
		summarizeBy: none
		sourceColumn: Inspection Code

	/// Descriptive title of the inspection, built from the property address and usually the inspection type, for example 'Inspection - 104/2 Hutt Road - Routine tenancy'; every value begins 'Inspection - '. It is never blank but not unique - there are far fewer distinct titles than rows because the same title recurs across a property's repeated inspections, so it should not be used as a record key. It is not a reusable inspection-type name; group by Category or Type to analyse by inspection type.
	column 'Inspection Name'
		dataType: string
		lineageTag: f543ac8e-1b28-4912-aaa4-94548a545c0f
		summarizeBy: none
		sourceColumn: Inspection Name

